\f2\b0\fs22 \cf3 This research employs a blended approach to document\
the maritime traditions of India\'92s northwestern littoral. This research initiative began with a critical review of\
existing primary and secondary sources, especially Malam Ni Pothi, a seminal compendium of astronavigation and\
seafaring knowledge to investigate its historical and methodological relevance for contextualizing maritime\
practices.\
